<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Oriental H1 net doubles.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Oriental H1 net doubles.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	114.3    vs	  55.7</p>
<p>    Turnover		 1,354.04   vs	 998.56</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   255.85   vs	 134.45</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less 15.85   vs  less  14.10</p>
<p>    Net profit		 164.94   vs	  80.36</p>
<p>    Dividend   (pct)	  12.5    vs	  12.5</p>
<p>Note - Oriental Holdings Bhd distributes Honda vehicles in Malaysia.</p>
</text>
